OL,3,ASnooker champion Graeme Dott guilty of
OL,4,Achild sex abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FLord Harrower told Dott, who won the
OL,7,Fsport's world championship at The
OL,8,FCrucible in 2006, will be sentenced at
OL,9,Fa separate hearing in Edinburgh on 29
OL,10,FSeptember.
